"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If start time is defined, "
"the project is scheduled forward from this time. When the project has been "
"calculated, end time shows when the project is planned to end.</p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If end time is defined, "
"the project is scheduled backwards from this time. When the project has been "
"calculated, start time shows when the project must start in order to finish "
"in time.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""

